  "worked_solution": "Any matrix, when multiplied by an identity matrix, remains unchanged (assuming that the multiplication is well defined).\n\nThe matrix $A$ is a $2\\times 2$ matrix and ${I}_{2}$ is a $2\\times 2$ matrix too. \n\nTherefore, the multiplication is well defined and \n\n$$\nA\\cdot {I}_{2}=A=[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 4 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{aligned}].\n$$",
